<runspec version="MOVES5.0.1">
	<description><![CDATA[County-domain inventory (model_domain=SINGLE) for Washtenaw, 2020, August weekday hour 7 -- scale-county's
timespan and county database (county-inputs/washtenaw-county/setup-county.sql) WITHOUT retrofit rows: the un-retrofitted twin
of scale-county-retrofit, captured to measure its factors.
Single-unit short-haul trucks (gasoline and diesel), the diesel combination
long-haul truck and the diesel transit bus; THC, CO, NOx, methane, NMHC, VOC and
the PM2.5 total with its four SulfatePMCalculator species (EC, NonECPM, sulfate,
water) at running and start exhaust; road types 1 and 4 (MOVES adds 2, 3 and 5).
Captured for moves.esm PLAN.md section 7.3.79 (On-Road Retrofit).]]></description>
